msgstr "状态已删除：%s"

#: src/main.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Delete failed: %s"
msgstr "删除失败：%s"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "File"
msgstr "文件"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Hide overlay"
msgstr "隐藏覆盖层"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Quit"
msgstr "退出"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Vsync"
msgstr "垂直同步"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Fullscreen"
msgstr "全屏"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "FPS counter"
msgstr "FPS 计数器"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "On-screen notifications"
msgstr "屏幕通知"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Light-gun mode"
msgstr "光枪模式"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Video"
msgstr "视频"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Wait for vertical blank before presenting.\n"
"Prevents tearing but adds up to one frame of latency."
msgstr ""
"显示前等待垂直消隐。\n"
"可防止画面撕裂，但会增加最多一帧的延迟。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Notifications"
msgstr "通知"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Automatic (system)"
msgstr "自动（系统）"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Language"
msgstr "语言"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "GPU"
msgstr "GPU"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Auto (best)"
msgstr "自动（最佳）"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Renderer"
msgstr "渲染器"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Software"
msgstr "软件"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Which renderer draws the game. Applies on the\n"
"next launch - save settings and relaunch."
msgstr ""
"用于绘制游戏的渲染器。下次启动时生效，\n"
"请保存设置并重新启动。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Window size"
msgstr "窗口大小"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Width"
msgstr "宽度"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Height"
msgstr "高度"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "1x (native)"
msgstr "1x（原生）"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "8x (4K)"
msgstr "8x（4K）"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "3D render scale"
msgstr "3D 渲染倍率"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Internal 3D rendering resolution. Higher is crisper 3D\n"
"(2D/HUD stays sharp). GPU backends only; the software\n"
"renderer stays native. Applies on the next launch - save\n"
"settings and relaunch."
msgstr ""
"内部 3D 渲染分辨率。越高 3D 越清晰\n"
"（2D/HUD 保持清晰）。仅限 GPU 后端；\n"
"软件渲染器保持原生分辨率。下次启动时生效，\n"
"请保存设置并重新启动。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Bilinear"
msgstr "双线性"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Integer"
msgstr "整数倍"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Nearest"
msgstr "最近邻"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sharp-bilinear"
msgstr "锐利双线性"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "2D scaling"
msgstr "2D 缩放"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"How the frame is magnified to the window.\n"
"Sharp-bilinear keeps 2D text crisp without the shimmer\n"
"nearest shows at non-integer window sizes. Integer snaps\n"
"to a whole multiple (pixel-perfect, with black bars).\n"
"Applies live."
msgstr ""
"将画面放大到窗口的方式。\n"
"锐利双线性可在非整数倍窗口尺寸下保持 2D 文字清晰，\n"
"且没有最近邻产生的闪烁。整数倍会对齐到整倍数\n"
"（像素精确，带黑边）。\n"
"即时生效。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "4:3 (arcade)"
msgstr "4:3（街机）"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Square pixels"
msgstr "方形像素"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Stretch"
msgstr "拉伸"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Aspect"
msgstr "宽高比"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"4:3 is the arcade monitor's shape (the default).\n"
"Square pixels shows the raw 496x384 (slightly narrow).\n"
"Stretch fills the whole window. Applies live."
msgstr ""
"4:3 是街机显示器的比例（默认）。\n"
"方形像素显示原始的 496x384（略窄）。\n"
"拉伸会填满整个窗口。即时生效。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "CRT filter"
msgstr "CRT 滤镜"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A cosmetic arcade-monitor look over the finished frame:\n"
"scanlines, an RGB shadow mask, glow and optional screen\n"
"curvature. Purely visual; applies live."
msgstr ""
"在完成的画面上叠加街机显示器外观：\n"
"扫描线、RGB 荫罩、辉光以及可选的屏幕\n"
"弯曲。纯视觉效果，即时生效。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scanlines"
msgstr "扫描线"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Mask"
msgstr "荫罩"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Glow"
msgstr "辉光"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Curvature"
msgstr "弯曲度"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enhancement (cosmetic, beyond the original hardware)"
msgstr "增强（视觉效果，超越原始硬件）"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Anisotropic"
msgstr "各向异性"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Faithful"
msgstr "原汁原味"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "3D texture filter"
msgstr "3D 纹理过滤"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "(unsupported)"
msgstr "（不支持）"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "This GPU does not report anisotropic filtering."
msgstr "此 GPU 未报告支持各向异性过滤。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Anisotropy"
msgstr "各向异性"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "2D upscale"
msgstr "2D 放大"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Edge-smooth the 2D layers (HUD, text, menus). xBR and\n"
"ScaleFX round diagonals; Faithful keeps crisp pixels.\n"
"Applies live."
msgstr ""
"平滑 2D 图层（HUD、文字、菜单）的边缘。xBR 和\n"
"ScaleFX 会使斜线圆滑；原汁原味保持像素清晰。\n"
"即时生效。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Blended"
msgstr "混合"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Stipple"
msgstr "点阵"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Translucency"
msgstr "半透明"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The hardware draws see-through surfaces (lights, glass,\n"
"shadows) as a checkerboard. Blended draws the 50%\n"
"see-through surface it's trying to achieve. Applies live."
msgstr ""
"硬件将半透明表面（灯光、玻璃、阴影）\n"
"绘制为棋盘格。混合模式绘制其想要实现的\n"
"50% 半透明表面。即时生效。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Custom textures"
msgstr "自定义纹理"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Replace the game's 3D textures with images saved in\n"
"saves/textures/<game>/load, named as dumped. GPU\n"
"renderers only; Reload picks up edited files."
msgstr ""
"用保存在 saves/textures/<game>/load 中、\n"
"按导出名称命名的图片替换游戏的 3D 纹理。\n"
"仅限 GPU 渲染器；“重新加载”可读取编辑后的文件。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%zu loaded"
msgstr "已加载 %zu 个"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reload"
msgstr "重新加载"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Dump textures"
msgstr "导出纹理"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Collect every 3D texture the game draws and write them,\n"
"with an index.html to browse, to saves/textures/<game>/dump\n"
"when the game exits or this is turned off."
msgstr ""
"收集游戏绘制的所有 3D 纹理，连同用于浏览的\n"
"index.html 写入 saves/textures/<game>/dump\n"
"（在游戏退出或关闭此选项时）。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Audio"
msgstr "音频"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Paths"
msgstr "路径"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Browse..."
msgstr "浏览..."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Config directory"
msgstr "配置目录"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Where sm2-emu.ini is read from and saved to.\n"
"Set with --config <dir>; cannot be changed here."
msgstr ""
"读取和保存 sm2-emu.ini 的位置。\n"
"通过 --config <dir> 设置；此处无法更改。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "ROM directory"
msgstr "ROM 目录"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Where the ROM archives live. A game launched by name is\n"
"loaded from here as <name>.zip or <name>.7z."
msgstr ""
"ROM 压缩包所在位置。按名称启动的游戏\n"
"会从这里以 <name>.zip 或 <name>.7z 加载。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Saves directory"
msgstr "存档目录"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Battery-backed saves: per-game NVRAM (.nv) and EEPROM\n"
"(.eeprom) images -- high scores and operator settings."
msgstr ""
"电池备份存档：每个游戏的 NVRAM（.nv）和 EEPROM\n"
"（.eeprom）镜像——最高分和运营设置。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshots directory"
msgstr "截图目录"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Where F12 screenshots are written."
msgstr "F12 截图的保存位置。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scrape artwork online"
msgstr "在线获取封面图"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Let the game picker fetch box art and descriptions from\n"
"ArcadeDB over the network. Off keeps sm2-emu offline: the\n"
"picker still lists and launches every game, with placeholder\n"
"tiles and no descriptions."
msgstr ""
"让游戏选择界面通过网络从 ArcadeDB 获取\n"
"封面图和简介。关闭后 sm2-emu 保持离线：\n"
"选择界面仍会列出并启动所有游戏，\n"
"但使用占位图块且没有简介。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Gamepad"
msgstr "手柄"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Wheel"
msgstr "方向盘"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Light Gun"
msgstr "光枪"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Network"
msgstr "网络"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "States"
msgstr "即时存档"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "About"
msgstr "关于"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "A Sega Model 2 arcade emulator"
msgstr "世嘉 Model 2 街机模拟器"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "BSD 3-Clause licence. See LICENSE."
msgstr "BSD 3-Clause 许可证。请参阅 LICENSE。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "sm2-emu exists because of open source shared with the community."
msgstr "sm2-emu 的存在得益于与社区共享的开源项目。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "With thanks to the projects whose code makes it possible:"
msgstr "感谢以下项目，它们的代码让这一切成为可能："

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "The MAME project - Sega Model 2 emulation guidance"
msgstr "MAME 项目 - 世嘉 Model 2 模拟参考"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Musashi - Motorola 68000 CPU core (Karl Stenerud)"
msgstr "Musashi - Motorola 68000 CPU 核心（Karl Stenerud）"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "ymfm - Yamaha FM sound cores (Aaron Giles)"
msgstr "ymfm - Yamaha FM 音源核心（Aaron Giles）"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "SDL - windowing, input and audio"
msgstr "SDL - 窗口、输入和音频"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Dear ImGui - this user interface (Omar Cornut)"
msgstr "Dear ImGui - 本用户界面（Omar Cornut）"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "pugixml - games.xml parsing"
msgstr "pugixml - games.xml 解析"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "miniz - ZIP archive decompression"
msgstr "miniz - ZIP 压缩包解压"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "LZMA SDK - 7-Zip archive decompression (Igor Pavlov)"
msgstr "LZMA SDK - 7-Zip 压缩包解压（Igor Pavlov）"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "VulkanMemoryAllocator - GPU memory (AMD / GPUOpen)"
msgstr "VulkanMemoryAllocator - GPU 内存（AMD / GPUOpen）"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "shaderc / glslang - shader compilation"
msgstr "shaderc / glslang - 着色器编译"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "stb_image - box-art image decoding (Sean Barrett)"
msgstr "stb_image - 封面图片解码（Sean Barrett）"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Gamepad picture - Xelu's Free Controller Prompts (Nicolae Berbece), CC0"
msgstr "手柄图片 - Xelu's Free Controller Prompts（Nicolae Berbece），CC0"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "libcurl - artwork scraping (optional)"
msgstr "libcurl - 封面图获取（可选）"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "HarfBuzz - text shaping for translations"
msgstr "HarfBuzz - 翻译文本塑形"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "SheenBidi - right-to-left text layout (Muhammad Tayyab Akram)"
msgstr "SheenBidi - 从右到左文本排版（Muhammad Tayyab Akram）"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game artwork and descriptions from ArcadeDB"
msgstr "游戏封面图和简介来自 ArcadeDB"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "(adb.arcadeitalia.net, by Motoschifo)."
msgstr "（adb.arcadeitalia.net，作者 Motoschifo）。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "See NOTICE for full per-component attribution."
msgstr "完整的各组件署名信息请参阅 NOTICE。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "If you'd like to support development:"
msgstr "如果您愿意支持开发："

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Save settings"
msgstr "保存设置"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Saved to %s"
msgstr "已保存到 %s"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Wheel connected."
msgstr "方向盘已连接。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "No wheel connected. Settings still apply once one is."
msgstr "未连接方向盘。连接后设置仍会生效。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Force feedback"
msgstr "力反馈"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Wheel force on driving games: centring and cornering\n"
"forces decoded from the game's own drive-board commands,\n"
"plus an impact jolt when you hit something."
msgstr ""
"赛车游戏中的方向盘力度：从游戏自身的驱动板\n"
"指令解码出的回中力和过弯力，\n"
"以及撞击时的冲击震动。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Resistance"
msgstr "阻力"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Invert force feedback"
msgstr "反转力反馈"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For a wheel whose driver pushes the wrong way: it pulls\n"
"away from the centre instead of bringing it back, and\n"
"the game's forces go the opposite way."
msgstr ""
"适用于驱动程序方向推反的方向盘：它不回中\n"
"而是被拉离中心，游戏的力也\n"
"朝相反方向作用。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rumble"
msgstr "震动"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Vibrates on the game's impacts, for wheels without force\n"
"feedback. It never runs alongside force feedback."
msgstr ""
"在游戏中发生撞击时震动，适用于没有力反馈的\n"
"方向盘。不会与力反馈同时运行。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rumble strength"
msgstr "震动强度"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Engine vibration"
msgstr "引擎震动"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An added vibration that grows with the throttle. It is not\n"
"from the game. Turn it off to feel only the game's force feedback."
msgstr ""
"随油门增大的附加震动。它并非\n"
"来自游戏。关闭后只感受游戏本身的力反馈。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%u deg"
msgstr "%u 度"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Steering range"
msgstr "转向范围"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Set this to your wheel's own rotation range. The lock\n"
"angle below is mapped onto it, so matching your wheel\n"
"gives arcade-like response."
msgstr ""
"设置为您方向盘自身的旋转范围。下方的锁定\n"
"角度会映射到该范围，与方向盘匹配\n"
"可获得接近街机的手感。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Lock angle"
msgstr "锁定角度"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%d deg"
msgstr "%d 度"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"How far to physically turn for full game lock (total,\n"
"so half each side of centre). Lower is more sensitive."
msgstr ""
"达到游戏中满舵所需的实际转动量（总计，\n"
"即中心两侧各一半）。数值越低越灵敏。"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Axes"
msgstr "轴"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Auto-detected. Recalibrate if steering or a pedal is wrong."
msgstr "已自动检测。如果转向或踏板不正确，请重新校准。"

